{
  "uid": "claude-code-flow",
  "title": "Claude Code flow timeline",
  "description": "When each persona's Claude Code sessions ran, prompted, called the model, used tools, ran workflows and subagents, compacted and failed, as timelines with one row per persona. Claude Code reports a persona only from a persona=<name> entry in OTEL_RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES (nexus writes it; the README's managed-settings block does not), so data without one gets no persona row: set the persona resource attribute.",
