  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Overview",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": [],
      "description": "All selected personas in one panel. Claude Code reports a persona only from a persona=<name> entry in OTEL_RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES (nexus writes it; the README's managed-settings block does not), so data without one gets no persona row: set the persona resource attribute."
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Personas: activity",
      "description": "One lane per persona: green \"tools\" where Claude Code ran at least one tool (tool_result event) in the bucket, blue \"model\" where it only called the model (api_request, no tool result), empty where idle. Each lane counts events per time bucket ($__auto: the bucket grows with the time range, about 30s at 6h, 2m at 24h, 15m at 7d); a block means at least one event in that bucket, not how long the work took. Events without a persona show as \"(none)\". Claude Code reports a persona only from a persona=<name> entry in OTEL_RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES (nexus writes it; the README's managed-settings block does not), so data without one gets no persona row: set the persona resource attribute. Follows VM, User, Environment, Persona and Session; ignores Model (Loki api_request events book advisor calls under the parent model).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "interval": "15s",
      "maxDataPoints": 600,
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "label_replace((sum by (persona) (count_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\", host_name=~\"$host\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$env\"} | event_name=\"tool_result\" | user_email=~\"$user\" | persona=~\"$persona\" | session_id=~\"$session\" [$__auto] offset -$__auto)) > bool 0) * 2 or (sum by (persona) (count_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\", host_name=~\"$host\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$env\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | user_email=~\"$user\" | persona=~\"$persona\" | session_id=~\"$session\" [$__auto] offset -$__auto)) > bool 0), \"persona\", \"(none)\", \"persona\", \"\")",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "{{persona}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "lineWidth": 0
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "idle",
                  "color": "transparent",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "model",
                  "color": "blue",
                  "index": 1
                },
                "2": {
                  "text": "tools",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 2
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mergeValues": true,
        "showValue": "never",
        "alignValue": "left",
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 200,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Persona: $persona",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": [],
      "repeat": "persona",
      "description": "Repeated once per selected persona; every panel in it shows only that persona. Claude Code reports a persona only from a persona=<name> entry in OTEL_RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES (nexus writes it; the README's managed-settings block does not), so data without one gets no persona row: set the persona resource attribute."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Flow",
      "description": "What this persona's Claude Code sessions did over time, one lane per kind, top to bottom: Prompts (user_prompt), Model calls (api_request), one \"Tool: <name>\" lane per tool that ran (tool_result), Workflows (any event of a Workflow tool run, i.e. with workflow_run_id), Subagents (subagent_completed, at the end of the subagent), Compactions, Failed tools (tool_result with success other than true) and API errors (api_error; no lane while there are none). Each lane counts events per time bucket ($__auto: the bucket grows with the time range, about 30s at 6h, 2m at 24h, 15m at 7d); a block means at least one event in that bucket, not how long the work took. Hover a block for its lane; the work log (panel link) lists the events. Follows VM, User, Environment, Persona and Session; ignores Model (Loki api_request events book advisor calls under the parent model). Claude Code reports a persona only from a persona=<name> entry in OTEL_RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES (nexus writes it; the README's managed-settings block does not), so data without one gets no persona row: set the persona resource attribute.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 12
      },
      "interval": "15s",
      "maxDataPoints": 600,
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum (count_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\", host_name=~\"$host\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$env\"} | event_name=\"user_prompt\" | user_email=~\"$user\" | persona=~\"$persona\" | session_id=~\"$session\" [$__auto] offset -$__auto))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "Prompts"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum (count_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\", host_name=~\"$host\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$env\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | user_email=~\"$user\" | persona=~\"$persona\" | session_id=~\"$session\" [$__auto] offset -$__auto))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "Model calls"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (tool_name) (count_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\", host_name=~\"$host\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$env\"} | event_name=\"tool_result\" | user_email=~\"$user\" | persona=~\"$persona\" | session_id=~\"$session\" [$__auto] offset -$__auto))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "Tool: {{tool_name}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum (count_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\", host_name=~\"$host\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$env\"} | workflow_run_id!=\"\" | user_email=~\"$user\" | persona=~\"$persona\" | session_id=~\"$session\" [$__auto] offset -$__auto))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "Workflows"
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum (count_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\", host_name=~\"$host\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$env\"} | event_name=\"subagent_completed\" | user_email=~\"$user\" | persona=~\"$persona\" | session_id=~\"$session\" [$__auto] offset -$__auto))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "Subagents"
        },
        {
          "refId": "F",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum (count_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\", host_name=~\"$host\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$env\"} | event_name=\"compaction\" | user_email=~\"$user\" | persona=~\"$persona\" | session_id=~\"$session\" [$__auto] offset -$__auto))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "Compactions"
        },
        {
          "refId": "G",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum (count_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\", host_name=~\"$host\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$env\"} | event_name=\"tool_result\" | success!=\"true\" | user_email=~\"$user\" | persona=~\"$persona\" | session_id=~\"$session\" [$__auto] offset -$__auto))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "Failed tools"
        },
        {
          "refId": "H",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum (count_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\", host_name=~\"$host\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$env\"} | event_name=\"api_error\" | user_email=~\"$user\" | persona=~\"$persona\" | session_id=~\"$session\" [$__auto] offset -$__auto))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "API errors"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
