    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Sessions",
      "description": "One lane per Claude Code session of this persona, labelled with the first 8 characters of its session id: a block where the session sent any event in the bucket. Each lane counts events per time bucket ($__auto: the bucket grows with the time range, about 30s at 6h, 2m at 24h, 15m at 7d); a block means at least one event in that bucket, not how long the work took. Click a block to open that session in the work log with the same time range. Follows VM, User, Environment, Persona and Session; ignores Model (Loki api_request events book advisor calls under the parent model). At most 1000 sessions (Loki max_query_series).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "interval": "15s",
      "maxDataPoints": 600,
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (session_id, session_short) (count_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\", host_name=~\"$host\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$env\"} | session_id!=\"\" | user_email=~\"$user\" | persona=~\"$persona\" | session_id=~\"$session\" | label_format session_short=`{{ trunc 8 .session_id }}` [$__auto] offset -$__auto))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "{{session_short}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "light-blue",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "lineWidth": 0
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Open this session in the work log",
              "oneClick": true,
              "url": "/d/claude-code-work?${__url_time_range}&${host:queryparam}&${user:queryparam}&${env:queryparam}&${model:queryparam}&var-session=${__field.labels.session_id}&var-prompt=.*"
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mergeValues": true,
        "showValue": "never",
        "alignValue": "left",
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Workflow runs",
      "description": "One lane per Workflow tool run (workflow_run_id, first 8 characters) of this persona: a block where the run, including its subagents, sent any event (API request, tool call, response) in the bucket. Each lane counts events per time bucket ($__auto: the bucket grows with the time range, about 30s at 6h, 2m at 24h, 15m at 7d); a block means at least one event in that bucket, not how long the work took. Click a block to open the run's session in the work log, whose Workflow runs table has the details. Follows VM, User, Environment, Persona and Session; ignores Model (Loki api_request events book advisor calls under the parent model). At most 1000 runs (Loki max_query_series).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "interval": "15s",
      "maxDataPoints": 600,
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (workflow_run_id, run_short, session_id) (count_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\", host_name=~\"$host\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$env\"} | workflow_run_id!=\"\" | user_email=~\"$user\" | persona=~\"$persona\" | session_id=~\"$session\" | label_format run_short=`{{ trunc 8 .workflow_run_id }}` [$__auto] offset -$__auto))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "Run {{run_short}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "lineWidth": 0
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Open this run's session in the work log",
              "oneClick": true,
              "url": "/d/claude-code-work?${__url_time_range}&${host:queryparam}&${user:queryparam}&${env:queryparam}&${model:queryparam}&var-session=${__field.labels.session_id}&var-prompt=.*"
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mergeValues": true,
        "showValue": "never",
        "alignValue": "left",
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Flow events",
      "description": "The events behind the Flow lanes for this persona, newest first: prompts, model calls (Model), tool calls (Tool, Success), subagents, compactions and API errors, with Duration (duration_ms of the model call or tool call), the Workflow run, prompt and session (first 8 characters). Shows the newest 500 events; narrow the time range or pick a Session for older ones. Click a Session or Prompt to open it in the work log with the same time range. Follows VM, User, Environment, Persona and Session; ignores Model (Loki api_request events book advisor calls under the parent model).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
